            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "less than two hundred twenty-five (225) minutes per week. In no instance shall any time block of less than thirty (30) minutes be considered planning time. For teachers in grades K through 12, such planning time shall be scheduled within the student day, unless agreed to otherwise by the principal and the teacher. Planning periods which are during the student-teacher contact day shall be used for planning and preparation as determined by the teacher, grade level, department or team.",
